@startuml
title Submit an expense
actor "Demo user" as User
participant Workspace as UI
participant "POST /api/changes" as Route
participant "Save handler" as Save
database SQLite as DB
User -> UI : Submit expense form
UI -> Route : POST expense fields and submission ID
Route -> Save : Parse form and save
Save -> DB : Read group membership and check submission ID
alt Valid new submission
  Save -> Save : Calculate equal or percentage shares in cents
  Save -> DB : Insert pending expense and shares in one transaction
  Save --> Route : Success
else Submission ID already exists
  Save --> Route : Success
else Validation fails
  Save --> Route : Validation message
end
Route --> UI : JSON result
UI -> UI : Refresh on success or display error
@enduml
